fact WorkItem(id: "WI-080", description: some(value: "Wire anthill.reflect.not(query: Term) -> Bool as eval-time negation-as-failure. Implementation: builtin in anthill-stl/src/reflect/builtins.rs wraps the goal in a resolver `not(...)` Fn term (functor = anthill.reflect.not) and runs a one-shot kb.resolve_lazy. Behavior: ground q with solutions → Bool(false); ground q with no solutions → Bool(true); ungrounded q → EvalError::Internal('floundering') since NAF is unsound on unground goals and eval-time has no outer frame to DELAY on. Reuses the existing resolver BuiltinTag::Not step_naf handling (resolve.rs:519) — one `not`, one meaning (NAF) across rule-body and eval-time invocation. Acceptance: 3 tests in anthill-stl (satisfiable → false, unsatisfiable → true, ungrounded → floundering error). All pass. Completes the eval-time surface of reflect.anthill. Delivered 2026-04-23."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-047"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-23T00:00:00Z"))
